# CODEOWNERS - required reviewers for security-sensitive paths only (enforced via
# the SB-892 org ruleset's "require Code Owner review"). There is deliberately NO
# catch-all owner: routine pull requests need no code-owner review, they are gated
# by CI and normal review. The security team is required ONLY on the paths below.
#
# Teams, not individuals, so this survives staff changes. @GetSensr-io/security
# has maintain access across the org, so these entries resolve.

# --- Security-relevant paths -> security team review ---
/.github/                @GetSensr-io/security
/.pre-commit-config.yaml @GetSensr-io/security
/.gitleaks.toml          @GetSensr-io/security
**/*auth*                @GetSensr-io/security
**/*token*               @GetSensr-io/security
**/*secret*              @GetSensr-io/security
**/*credential*          @GetSensr-io/security
**/*password*            @GetSensr-io/security
**/*.pem                 @GetSensr-io/security
**/*.keystore            @GetSensr-io/security
**/*.jks                 @GetSensr-io/security
